WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.486
Mrs. Rabbit came home.

2
00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:23.443
"Where are my bunnies?" she said.

3
00:00:23.444 --> 00:00:34.839
Then she saw the empty basket.

4
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:46.595
Mrs. Rabbit quickly hopped across the field.

5
00:00:46.596 --> 00:00:50.242
She spotted Flopsy near the trash pile.

6
00:00:50.243 --> 00:00:55.619
"Help!" cried Flopsy.

7
00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.375
Mrs. Rabbit and Flopsy pulled at the string.

8
00:00:59.376 --> 00:01:05.271
But it was too tight.

9
00:01:05.272 --> 00:01:13.597
"I can help!" called Mrs. Tittlemouse.

10
00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:17.721
She nibbled the string.

11
00:01:17.722 --> 00:01:25.224
And the string broke!

12
00:01:25.225 --> 00:01:28.963
"Hide your bunnies," said Mrs. Tittlemouse.

13
00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:37.722
"The farmer will be back soon!"

14
00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:55.237
Mrs. Rabbit smiled. "I have a plan."

15
00:01:55.238 --> 00:02:04.127
Soon the farmer came back for the sack.

16
00:02:04.128 --> 00:02:07.029
He brought it to his wife.

17
00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:11.218
"Three rabbits!" the farmer said.

18
00:02:11.219 --> 00:02:15.084
"We can have a special treat."

19
00:02:15.085 --> 00:02:19.109
The farmer's wife looked in the sack.

20
00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.978
"These aren't rabbits!" she yelled.

21
00:02:22.979 --> 00:02:28.885
"What?" The farmer looked in the sack.

22
00:02:28.886 --> 00:02:32.079
"Rotting vegetables!"

23
00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:39.267
Outside the five bunnies laughed.

24
00:02:39.268 --> 00:02:43.504
"Your plan worked, Mother," said Flopsy.

25
00:02:43.505 --> 00:02:47.671
"You tricked the farmer!" said Peter.

26
00:02:47.672 --> 00:02:52.723
Mrs. Rabbit nodded. "Come on, bunnies.

27
00:02:52.724 --> 00:02:54.732
It's time to go home."

28
00:02:54.733 --> 00:02:57.912
"Yes," said three bunnies.

29
00:02:57.913 --> 00:03:05.452
"We're hungry again!"

